<section
  class="py-section-gap px-margin-mobile md:px-margin-desktop bg-surface-container"
  id="testimoni"
>
  <div class="max-w-container-max mx-auto flex flex-col gap-12">
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 items-center text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto">
      <span
        class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-secondary uppercase tracking-widest"
        >Testimoni</span
      >
      <h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-primary">
        Apa Kata Mereka?
      </h2>
      <div class="w-12 h-px bg-primary/30 mt-2"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      <!-- Review 1 -->
      <div
        class="bg-surface p-8 rounded-lg border border-outline-variant/20 flex flex-col gap-6"
      >
        <div class="flex text-primary">
          <span
            class="material-symbols-outlined"
            style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1">star</span
          >
          <span
            class="material-symbols-outlined"
            style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1">star</span
          >
          <span
            class="material-symbols-outlined"
            style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1">star</span
          >
          <span
            class="material-symbols-outlined"
            style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1">star</span
          >
          <span
            class="material-symbols-outlined"
            style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1">star</span
          >
        </div>
        <p class="font-body-md text-on-surface-variant italic flex-grow">
          "Kualitas kayunya luar biasa. Ukirannya sangat halus dan detail.
          Benar-benar sepadan dengan harganya. Meja makan saya sekarang jadi
          pusat perhatian setiap ada tamu."
        </p>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
          <div
            class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center font-headline-md text-primary"
          >
            B
          </div>
          <div>
            <h4 class="font-body-md font-semibold text-primary">
              Budi Santoso
            </h4>
            <span class="text-sm text-on-surface-variant">Jakarta</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <!-- Review 2 -->
      <div
        class="bg-surface p-8 rounded-lg border border-outline-variant/20 flex flex-col gap-6"
      >
        <div class="flex text-primary">
          <span
            class="material-symbols-outlined"
            style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1">star</span
          >
          <span
            class="material-symbols-outlined"
            style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1">star</span
          >
          <span
            class="material-symbols-outlined"
            style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1">star</span
          >
          <span
            class="material-symbols-outlined"
            style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1">star</span
          >
          <span
            class="material-symbols-outlined"
            style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1">star</span
          >
        </div>
        <p class="font-body-md text-on-surface-variant italic flex-grow">
          "Pesan kursi tamu custom, hasilnya melebihi ekspektasi. Pengrajinnya
          sangat komunikatif dan mengerti apa yang saya inginkan. Pengiriman
          juga aman sampai Surabaya."
        </p>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
          <div
            class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center font-headline-md text-primary"
          >
            A
          </div>
          <div>
            <h4 class="font-body-md font-semibold text-primary">
              Anita Wijaya
            </h4>
            <span class="text-sm text-on-surface-variant">Surabaya</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <!-- Review 3 -->
      <div
        class="bg-surface p-8 rounded-lg border border-outline-variant/20 flex flex-col gap-6"
      >
        <div class="flex text-primary">
          <span
            class="material-symbols-outlined"
            style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1">star</span
          >
          <span
            class="material-symbols-outlined"
            style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1">star</span
          >
          <span
            class="material-symbols-outlined"
            style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1">star</span
          >
          <span
            class="material-symbols-outlined"
            style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1">star</span
          >
          <span
            class="material-symbols-outlined"
            style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 0">star</span
          >
        </div>
        <p class="font-body-md text-on-surface-variant italic flex-grow">
          "Lemari klasiknya sangat kokoh dan desainnya elegan. Finishingnya
          rapi. Sangat merekomendasikan Aurum Teak untuk yang mencari furniture
          jati berkualitas."
        </p>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
          <div
            class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center font-headline-md text-primary"
          >
            D
          </div>
          <div>
            <h4 class="font-body-md font-semibold text-primary">
              Diana Puspita
            </h4>
            <span class="text-sm text-on-surface-variant">Bandung</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
